# Lecture 10C

## Chromosomal Positions

## Chapter 9

## Dr. Neil Voss

## November 10, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Identify the p and q arms of a chromosome
- Decode chromosome, arm, region, band, and subband
- Compare band positions on the same chromosome arm
- Read a simple chromosome-number notation

=== layout: definitions

# Chromosome Address Terms

@body

- [*Centromere*]{color=#24578F}: the constricted region separating the two arms
- [*p Arm*]{color=#24578F}: the short arm; p = petite
- [*q Arm*]{color=#24578F}: the long arm; q = not p
- [*Cytogenetic Address*]{color=#24578F}: chromosome, arm, and a stained band location

