# CFTR: Read Each Part

@left

{table-style=comparison text-align=left}
| Address Part | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| [*7*]{color=#D40000} | Chromosome 7 |
| [*q*]{color=#B74300} | Long arm |
| [*3*]{color=#007A00} | Region 3 |
| [*1*]{color=#003FFF} | Band 1 |
| [*.2*]{color=#A719DB} | Subband 2 |

@right

![CFTR chromosome address hierarchy: 7q31.2](assets/visual_renewal/cftr_address.drawn.svg)

@citation

https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/understanding/howgeneswork/genelocation/

